<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>CI/CD on ToPass</title><link>https://ziaenezhad.ir/en/tags/ci/cd/</link><description>Recent content in CI/CD on ToPass</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ziaenezhad.ir/en/tags/ci/cd/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to update Gitlab Runners?</title><link>https://ziaenezhad.ir/en/p/how-to-update-gitlab-runner/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ziaenezhad.ir/en/p/how-to-update-gitlab-runner/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://ziaenezhad.ir/en/p/how-to-update-gitlab-runner/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post How to update Gitlab Runners?" /&gt;&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;&lt;a href="#introduction" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Introduction&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab Runner is an application that works with GitLab CI/CD to run jobs in a pipeline. GitLab Runner is open-source and written in Go. It can be run as a single binary; no language-specific requirements are needed.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="how-to-update"&gt;&lt;a href="#how-to-update" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;How to update?&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="stop-the-service"&gt;&lt;a href="#stop-the-service" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Stop the service&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sudo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;gitlab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;runner&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;stop&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="download-the-binary-to-replace-the-gitlab-runner-executable"&gt;&lt;a href="#download-the-binary-to-replace-the-gitlab-runner-executable" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Download the binary to replace the GitLab Runner executable&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We can see the list of all releases in the &lt;a class="link" href="https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-runner/-/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;Official Gitlab Runner&lt;/a&gt; repository.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;In this case I had an Ubuntu machine and wanted to update to the latest &lt;code&gt;v14.x&lt;/code&gt; machine. so the proer version is &lt;code&gt;v14.8.3&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sudo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;curl&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;L&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;output&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;usr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;bin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;gitlab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;runner&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://gitlab-runner-downloads.s3.amazonaws.com/v14.8.3/binaries/gitlab-runner-linux-amd64&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="setting-permissions-to-execute"&gt;&lt;a href="#setting-permissions-to-execute" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Setting permissions to execute&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sudo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;chmod&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;usr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;bin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;gitlab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;runner&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="starting-the-service"&gt;&lt;a href="#starting-the-service" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Starting the service&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;sudo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;gitlab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;runner&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;start&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Done 🙂&lt;/p&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>